<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Cardoso accepts compromise on reform bill.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Cardoso accepts compromise on reform bill.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian President Fernando Henrique Cardoso accepted a controversial compromise involving the government's civil service reform bill as the &quot;price which must be paid,&quot; a presidential spokesman said.</p>
<p>Spokesman Sergio Amaral also said the government intended to press ahead with the vote later Wednesday.</p>
